type: software
title: "fast-vollib"
abstract: >-
  Accelerated derivatives pricing, implied volatility, Greeks, typed instruments,
  and Monte Carlo simulation for Black, Black-Scholes and Black-Scholes-Merton
  models, with pluggable NumPy, PyTorch and JAX backends and a
  compatibility-first functional API modeled on py_vollib_vectorized.
